{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Batch\/timeout(_:customError:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timeout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"duration","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"customError","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (any ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP","text":"Error","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")? = nil) -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO7TimeoutV","text":"Timeout","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Timeout"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency15SuspendingClockV","text":"SuspendingClock","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"duration","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The longest the sequence may go without an element."}]}]},{"name":"customError","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The error to throw when the timer fires. Defaults to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimeoutError.timedOut(duration:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A sequence of the same elements that throws if the upstream goes quiet."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The timer starts when iteration begins and restarts with every element, so it bounds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wait for the first element and each gap after it, never the sequence as a whole. Elements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass through unchanged. When the timer fires, the upstream is cancelled and the sequence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and elements it produces while the consumer is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"busy are buffered, so the timer measures the upstream’s gaps. A duration of zero or less"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws before the first element."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading"},{"code":["for try await event in serverEvents.timeout(.seconds(30)) {","    handle(event)","}","\/\/ Throws TimeoutError.timedOut if 30 seconds pass without an event"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"TimeoutError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (or ","type":"text"},{"code":"customError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") when ","type":"text"},{"code":"duration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" passes between elements, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"any error the upstream throws.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentatio